X: 1
T: Gas
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: The gas station holdup cue from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody (channel 0) of
N: a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7944), moved up an octave into recorder range; key D
N: minor as in the source; chords fitted from the accompaniment (Dm7 vamp with
N: Bb, Gm7 and Eb7 answers). The sixteenth-note pushes of the source are
N: straightened to the eighth; pitches are the source's. Scope: the ostinato
N: verse and its close (source bars 5-17); the Eb and F# of the last bars are the
N: source's chromatics.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=120
M: 4/4
K: Dm
